{
  "chapter.475548589904BBD3.title": "&6Verhalen van de Guhbarbecuether",
  "chapter.475548589904BBD3.chapter_subtitle": [
    "2. Eén knabbel om ze allemaal te delen, en een prinses in een ander kasteeldeel",
  ],
  "task.475548EEE49D8B29.title": "Baltoguh en Nomguh",
  "task.475548EBE4C1CAFD.title": "Guhtwo en het kloon-eiland",
  "task.4755488983BB9CAB.title": "Het Hemelkapelletje",
  "task.475548AE4378BB03.title": "Ohana op Guhwai'i",
  "task.4755480C3B377481.title": "Het Snuffeleiland",
  "quest.475548516096A3F5.title": "Slotje: eerst de Guhmensie",
  "quest.475548516096A3F5.quest_desc": [
    "&cDit hoofdstuk zit op slot&r tot je de grote verhalen van de &dGuhmensie&r hebt gevolgd. Hieronder zie je welke je al hebt: een vinkje per verhaal. Mis je er nog een? &dGuhdalf&r en het grillportaal zeggen het je ook, njeg.",
    "",
    "Heb je ze allemaal, en brandt de barbecue van de Grillguh weer (&6VAHOEG, hij brandt weer!&r in &6De Guhbarbecuether&r)? Dan staat er bezoek bij de grote barbecueput. &dGuhdalf&r heeft een ringvormige knabbel bij zich waar iedereen hebberig van wordt. Hij moet naar de &6Frituurberg&r, diep in de Guhbarbecuether: niet om hem kapot te maken, maar om hem te frituren en te delen. Pas na zijn feest laat het grillportaal je door.",
    "",
    "&6In de ban van de Knabbelring&r is het enige verhaal waarin de quests &cecht na elkaar&r komen: volg ze van boven naar beneden. Daaronder staat &cSuper Guhrio&r: in een frituursauszee staat het &cKasteel van de Grote Nether-Mika&r (superkompas: Barbecue). Binnen speel je alles &cvan opzij&r: A en D lopen, spatie springt. Vallen kost niks.",
    "",
    "Je &dGuhdex&r (tab Verhalen) laat het hele Guhpad zien, en &dMijn verhaal&r in je superkompas wijst steeds de weg.",
  ],
  "quest.4755482EBB284428.title": "A Wizard Is Never Late",
  "quest.4755482EBB284428.quest_desc": [
    "At the &6big Barbecue Pit&r in the Guhmension stands a cart full of fireworks. That's &dGuhdalf&r. Talk to him: he's looking for someone with sturdy pawsies for a VERY important little job. The &6grill portal&r to the Guhbarbecuether won't work again until you've helped him, nyeg.",
  ],
  "quest.47554846AEA76143.title": "I'm Not Going Without You",
  "quest.47554846AEA76143.quest_desc": [
    "&dSam-guh&r walks the whole journey with you, with all his pans on his back. Click him: he tells you what to do now and which way to go. Everyone has their own Sam-guh.",
  ],
  "quest.4755485FB25EA920.title": "Catching Your Breath",
  "quest.4755485FB25EA920.quest_desc": [
    "Along the way you'll find &6rest stops&r: a little camp with a &6Rest Fire&r. Walk up to it and it's your rest stop. If you get spotted or caught, that's where you come back to. You never lose anything. And Sam-guh cooks up a stew, wahoog!",
  ],
  "quest.475548C9578283D1.title": "Don't Put It On!",
  "quest.475548C9578283D1.quest_desc": [
    "Right-click with the &6Nibble Ring&r and you put it on. Mikas can't see you anymore... but the &cEye of Sauceron&r sees you very well indeed, and in the Guhbarbecuether the &cNine&r come to fetch you. So take it off again quickly. Or don't, nyeg.",
  ],
  "quest.475548B5F0E7F591.title": "Outrunning the Nine",
  "quest.475548B5F0E7F591.quest_desc": [
    "Nine &cSkelly Mika Riders&r. They won't do a thing to you: they only shove you back to your last rest stop. Take the ring off, run away fast or dazzle them with the Light Phial until they've lost you.",
  ],
  "quest.4755485780C0891F.title": "The Gifts of Guhladriel",
  "quest.4755485780C0891F.quest_desc": [
    "Three little presents for the road: the &bLight Phial&r (a flash, and a little lamp in your hand), the &aLittle Elven Cloak&r (crouch and stand still: you look like a rock) and the &7Elven Rope&r (pulls you to a hook).",
  ],
  "quest.4755487F5B08521F.title": "I'm a Rock, Nyeg",
  "quest.4755487F5B08521F.quest_desc": [
    "With the Little Elven Cloak on you: &6crouch and stand very still&r. The Eye and the riders will look right past you. No sneezing.",
  ],
  "quest.475548FB80B107F2.title": "Hup, Up You Go",
  "quest.475548FB80B107F2.quest_desc": [
    "Look at an &6Elven Rope Hook&r and right-click with the Elven Rope: it pulls you over, from up to 24 blocks away. After the story you can make hooks yourself and hang them anywhere.",
  ],
  "quest.4755488DECB5CE4B.title": "But I Can Carry You",
  "quest.4755488DECB5CE4B.quest_desc": [
    "At Mount Fry the ring gets heavier and heavier. Then click Sam-guh: &dI can't carry the ring, but I can carry you, nyeg!&r",
  ],
  "quest.47554822A0C71AC2.title": "Ring-Bearer",
  "quest.47554822A0C71AC2.quest_desc": [
    "The Nibble Ring has been fried and shared. You have the title &6Ring-Bearer&r, four outfits (Guhdalf's pointy hat with beard, the elven cloak, hairy hobbit feet and the ring on a chain) and the statuette of the Eye that blinks.",
  ],
  "quest.47554854740265A3.title": "Sam-guh Gets to Come Home",
  "quest.47554854740265A3.quest_desc": [
    "After the party Sam-guh is still standing next to you. Click him and he's yours forever. One time, only for you.",
  ],
  "quest.475548E5D664C932.title": "Tasty Fishesss",
  "quest.475548E5D664C932.quest_desc": [
    "&dSmikagol&r is your buddy now. Put him near water (crouch and click: then he stays put) and he catches fish for you. Lost him? The &6fish bone&r calls him.",
  ],
  "quest.475548DB0FB7DAA1.title": "There's Always Something to Celebrate",
  "quest.475548DB0FB7DAA1.quest_desc": [
    "In the Nibble Shire it's a party every day now. One &6Party Nibble&r a day, or you'll roll down the hill.",
  ],
  "quest.475548622257E13C.title": "Off on an Adventure!",
  "quest.475548622257E13C.quest_desc": [
    "This way you'll never lose your way: at the &6top left&r it says what to do now, the &dGuhdex&r (Tales tab) holds your &6Journey Map&r, the &6Super Compass&r points to 'My Story' and Sam-guh knows too. The chapters below open one by one.",
  ],
  "quest.4755488107709AAF.title": "Right on Time",
  "quest.4755488107709AAF.quest_desc": [
    "Talk to &dGuhdalf&r at the &6big Barbecue Pit&r in the Guhmension (the Grill Guh's barbecue has to be burning first). He tells you about a nibble in the shape of a ring. And about a party.",
  ],
  "quest.475548FA74974184.title": "The Party Won't Set Itself",
  "quest.475548FA74974184.quest_desc": [
    "Three little jobs at Guhdalf's cart: launch a &6rocket&r from the crate, set the &6party table&r and invite &dSam-guh&r. Everyone can do this: nothing runs out.",
  ],
  "quest.4755481915234A3F.title": "A Long-Expected Nibble Party",
  "quest.4755481915234A3F.quest_desc": [
    "Talk to Guhdalf again. The farewell party begins, with a speech, lots of cake and a present: the &6Nibble Ring&r. Don't eat it. Don't put it on. Nyeg.",
  ],
  "quest.4755483156F87F38.title": "I'm Coming Too!",
  "quest.4755483156F87F38.quest_desc": [
    "Talk to &dSam-guh&r. From now on he walks the whole journey with you, with all his pans on his back.",
  ],
  "quest.4755486636D10961.title": "Not Without Sausage",
  "quest.4755486636D10961.quest_desc": [
    "Pack the provisions: click the three &6Provisions Crates&r by the cart (sausage, cheese and nibbles). Sam-guh has to be nearby to take them.",
  ],
  "quest.47554845D9E97172.title": "Farther from Home than Ever",
  "quest.47554845D9E97172.quest_desc": [
    "Walk with Sam-guh to the &6grill portal&r of the Barbecue Pit. That finishes chapter 1 and the portal works again: the Guhbarbecuether awaits!",
  ],
  "quest.475548782332D104.title": "The Last Cozy House",
  "quest.475548782332D104.quest_desc": [
    "You're through the grill portal. Walk with &dSam-guh&r through the Guhbarbecuether to &6Guhvendell&r, the house of Guhrond in the Sausage Woods. You'll know it by the three waterfalls of cheese sauce. The &6Super Compass&r (My Story) shows the way.",
  ],
  "quest.475548DB27D76041.title": "Guhrond",
  "quest.475548DB27D76041.quest_desc": [
    "Talk to &dGuhrond&r. He's standing on the doorstep of the big white house. That house is three thousand years old. So is the cheese sauce, nyeg.",
  ],
  "quest.475548AAB61E89E5.title": "The Company",
  "quest.475548AAB61E89E5.quest_desc": [
    "Get to know &dAraguh&r (at the gate: he wants to see if you can sneak), &dLeguhlas&r and &dGimguh&r (in the garden, by their pile of nibbles), &dBoromika&r (in the hall) and &dMerry&r and &dPippguh&r (in the kitchen, where else). Watch your bag.",
  ],
  "quest.4755486D4B9F6967.title": "The Council of Guhrond",
  "quest.4755486D4B9F6967.quest_desc": [
    "Ring the &6bell&r in the council ring, the round ring of pillars on the far side of the bridge. Then the council begins. Everyone wants to eat the ring. Gimguh even gives it a try.",
  ],
  "quest.475548F18476648A.title": "I Will Take the Ring!",
  "quest.475548F18476648A.quest_desc": [
    "The council is squabbling. Tell &dGuhrond&r that you will take the Nibble Ring to Mount Fry. You get provisions for the road. And eight companions. Nobody asked for eight.",
  ],
  "quest.4755483367A385A7.title": "The Fellowship",
  "quest.4755483367A385A7.quest_desc": [
    "Talk to &dGuhdalf&r when you're ready to leave. After that the journey goes on to the &6Mines of Nibblemoria&r. Guhrond stays living in Guhvendell: you're always welcome back.",
  ],
  "quest.47554803A1275A18.title": "Underneath",
  "quest.47554803A1275A18.quest_desc": [
    "Over the mountain won't work, around it takes too long. Walk with Sam-guh to the &6Mines of Nibblemoria&r: the &dSuper Compass&r (My Story) shows the way, quite a walk from Guhvendell. Until you get there, all you'll see is Guhdalf's smoke.",
  ],
  "quest.475548C709CBAB56.title": "Say Nyeg and Enter",
  "quest.475548C709CBAB56.quest_desc": [
    "The gate is shut tight and Guhdalf is out of ideas too. Above the door glows a spell. Read it &6very literally&r and type the word in chat. (Or click the glowing runes and pick the right answer.)",
  ],
  "quest.475548FA72DB6532.title": "The Hall of Levers",
  "quest.475548FA72DB6532.quest_desc": [
    "Four levers, each under a sign. On the stone in the middle is a little rhyme about how a dwarf guh eats: pull the levers in &6that order&r. One wrong lever and everything jumps back. Everyone solves this riddle for themselves.",
  ],
  "quest.4755488366BD2125.title": "Fool of a Pippguh",
  "quest.4755488366BD2125.quest_desc": [
    "Through the portcullis lies an old guard room with a well. Pippguh spots a little bucket sitting on the edge. &cNobody touches that bucket.&r Nyeg.",
  ],
  "quest.47554856F98791FE.title": "Gimguh's Secret Passage",
  "quest.47554856F98791FE.quest_desc": [
    "The corridor has caved in and the drums are coming closer. Talk to &dGimguh&r: there's a dwarf door in the wall. Knock &6three times&r on the rune of what Durguh liked best to eat. His tomb is in the very same room...",
  ],
  "quest.4755481A68B93725.title": "YOU.. SHALL.. NOT.. VADS!",
  "quest.4755481A68B93725.quest_desc": [
    "In the Hall of Pillars something wakes up: the &cBarbecuerog&r, a demon of charcoal and fire. He won't do a thing to you (at most he puts you back at your rest fire), but &6run&r: across the &6Crumble Path&r, which drops away under your pawsies, and the narrow &6Bridge of Nibble-dûm&r. On the other side... just watch.",
  ],
  "quest.475548D09FE407D8.title": "Just Say It",
  "quest.475548D09FE407D8.quest_desc": [
    "You said the word out loud in chat, just as it's written. It took Guhdalf three spells.",
  ],
  "quest.4755484AAD278F37.title": "A Quick Trip into the Deep",
  "quest.4755484AAD278F37.quest_desc": [
    "The Crumble Path holds out exactly long enough. Usually. If you fall, you're right back at your rest fire: you don't lose a thing.",
  ],
  "quest.475548C880C5C2D5.title": "Strung on the Sausage",
  "quest.475548C880C5C2D5.quest_desc": [
    "The Barbecuerog's whip is a row of little bratwursts knotted together. You'll notice when he catches you with it. You smell like barbecue for an hour afterwards.",
  ],
  "quest.475548A7D93D54A1.title": "The Way Out",
  "quest.475548A7D93D54A1.quest_desc": [
    "Guhdalf has fallen. Climb the &6long stairs&r to the East Gate and talk to &dAraguh&r outside. Gimguh chipped four more &6runestones&r out of the wall for you: knock on one for a different sign. You can watch the scenes again in the &dGuhdex&r.",
  ],
  "quest.475548FF3BCBB641.title": "The Golden Wood",
  "quest.475548FF3BCBB641.quest_desc": [
    "After the mine the &6Super Compass&r ('My Story') points to &dGuhlórien&r, where the satay trees turn gold. Walk to the gate of the tree city &6Caras Guhladhon&r. As soon as you're there, Guhdalf's Veil opens for you.",
  ],
  "quest.47554819F0D6EB10.title": "Elf Eyes",
  "quest.47554819F0D6EB10.quest_desc": [
    "At the gate stands &dLeguhlas&r. He saw you coming days ago and has an opinion about it. Talk to him.",
  ],
  "quest.475548B65899201F.title": "Lady Guhladriel",
  "quest.475548B65899201F.quest_desc": [
    "Climb the big spiral staircase around the &6Great Skewer&r, all the way up to the hall under the crown. That's where &dGuhladriel&r sits. She knows everything already, but have a little chat with her anyway. Falling doesn't hurt in her city.",
  ],
  "quest.47554885A69B7E3A.title": "Sleeping Like a Chonky Log",
  "quest.47554885A69B7E3A.quest_desc": [
    "On the &6guest platform&r (the tree by the gate) a &6Rest Fire&r is burning and there are sleeping bags. Snuggle in. This is your rest stop right away.",
  ],
  "quest.4755486C46E124A0.title": "The Mirror of Guhladriel",
  "quest.4755486C46E124A0.quest_desc": [
    "In the middle of the night Guhladriel walks to the green dell. Right-click the &bMirror&r and see what was, what is, and what has yet to be baked. Don't be startled by the Eye: he's only a tiny bit hungry.",
  ],
  "quest.4755488BFB2073B5.title": "Three Gifts",
  "quest.4755488BFB2073B5.quest_desc": [
    "Talk to Guhladriel at the mirror. You get the &bLight Phial&r, the &aLittle Elven Cloak&r and the &7Elven Rope&r. You'll really need them further on. Lost one? Guhladriel gives you a new one.",
  ],
  "quest.4755483A1E5F05A3.title": "Between the Guh Kings",
  "quest.4755483A1E5F05A3.quest_desc": [
    "At the dock, hop into Leguhlas's &6Elven Boat&r (click the boat or him). It sails down the &dGuhduin&r all by itself, past the two giant statues of the &6Arguhnath&r. Stay comfy in your seat and look up.",
  ],
  "quest.475548214A57A4BE.title": "At the Edge of Ash Vale",
  "quest.475548214A57A4BE.quest_desc": [
    "The journey goes on to &6Ash Vale&r. Your Super Compass ('My Story') and Sam-guh show the way to the camp in front of the &cBlack Grill Gate&r. A rest fire is burning there.",
  ],
  "quest.475548CC2C484D90.title": "Just One Little Bite",
  "quest.475548CC2C484D90.quest_desc": [
    "By the fire sits &dBoromika&r, a Mika who REALLY wants to help. Talk to him. He does stare at your ring for an awfully long time, though...",
  ],
  "quest.4755484BA5C3ECBC.title": "We Swears It on the Chonkie",
  "quest.4755484BA5C3ECBC.quest_desc": [
    "Something is rustling by the provisions. It's &dSmikagol&r, a skinny Mika who has lost his 'chonkie'. He knows a sneak path past the Eye. Click him and let him show the way. Sam-guh wouldn't trust him with a single nibble.",
  ],
  "quest.475548A6489CC14A.title": "The Eye of Sauceron",
  "quest.475548A6489CC14A.quest_desc": [
    "Follow Smikagol up the ridge. Up there you see it for the first time: the gate, the tower and the &cEye&r. His gaze is a &6patch of light on the ground&r. That's where he's looking.",
  ],
  "quest.47554872A16D0BA9.title": "From Wall to Wall",
  "quest.47554872A16D0BA9.quest_desc": [
    "Cross the &6Ash Field&r. The light of the Eye sweeps back and forth: wait behind a little wall or under a little roof until it has passed, then run to the next one. Spotted? Then you're back at your last rest fire. You don't lose a thing.",
  ],
  "quest.475548DAB2FAD6CC.title": "I'm a Rock. Really.",
  "quest.475548DAB2FAD6CC.quest_desc": [
    "On the &6Bare Plain&r there's nothing to sit behind. With the &aLittle Elven Cloak&r on you: &6crouch and stand still&r when the light comes your way. The Eye thinks rocks are boring.",
  ],
  "quest.475548A7C5677FA3.title": "Shadow Lane",
  "quest.475548A7C5677FA3.quest_desc": [
    "Under the wall the Eye isn't looking. But there's &7smoke&r hanging about (let the &bLight Phial&r flash: poof, gone) and two riders of the &cNine&r are riding by. A flash dazzles them, and they ride right past a rock.",
  ],
  "quest.475548F09C03DDE9.title": "Do You Smell Nibble Too?",
  "quest.475548F09C03DDE9.quest_desc": [
    "Three &cGrill Guards&r at the Guard Fence. Mikas can't see a ring-bearer: put the &6Nibble Ring&r on at the skull post, walk through the fence and take it off again &6right away&r. The Eye feels the ring, and the Nine smell it.",
  ],
  "quest.475548DA5C2304D9.title": "Guhdalf the White",
  "quest.475548DA5C2304D9.quest_desc": [
    "The &6Little Grill Door&r is locked and the Nine are coming. But look who's standing up there on the wall...",
  ],
  "quest.475548ED81561ACC.title": "Round the Back",
  "quest.475548ED81561ACC.quest_desc": [
    "Through the little door, down the tunnel under the wall. You've sneaked past the Eye of Sauceron, wahoog! Sam-guh gives you two stews for the climb: now there's only &cMount Fry&r left.",
  ],
  "quest.475548EB840BDF6E.title": "There It Stands",
  "quest.475548EB840BDF6E.quest_desc": [
    "Beyond the Black Grill Gate the &6Smoke Delta&r begins. In the middle of the fumes stands &cMount Fry&r. Walk with Sam-guh to the &6Base Camp&r on the south side and warm up by the Rest Fire. The Super Compass shows the way (My Story).",
  ],
  "quest.4755484F59191493.title": "The Winding Path",
  "quest.4755484F59191493.quest_desc": [
    "Behind the gate the &6Winding Path&r twists around the mountain. The mountain throws &cembers&r: they don't hurt, they only shove you. On the First Ledge a &dSmoke Guhling&r sits in a cage: the Mikas are using it as a range hood! Click the lock.",
  ],
  "quest.4755483694F3580A.title": "Up the Rope",
  "quest.4755483694F3580A.quest_desc": [
    "The path has caved in. Look up: under every &6hook&r hangs a little blue lamp. Right-click with the &7Elven Rope&r and you get pulled up. Two hooks further on sits the second Smoke Guhling. And Smikagol is grabbing at your ring: &bflash him away&r with the Light Phial.",
  ],
  "quest.475548329EDF46D4.title": "Heavier and Heavier",
  "quest.475548329EDF46D4.quest_desc": [
    "The higher you go, the heavier the ring. Follow the narrow path to the east side, take the last hook and free the third Smoke Guhling. Falling is no trouble at all: you come back at your last Rest Fire.",
  ],
  "quest.4755485F9CCE3373.title": "But I Can Carry You",
  "quest.4755485F9CCE3373.quest_desc": [
    "The ring now weighs as much as a whole cheese shop. Click &dSam-guh&r. &dI can't carry the ring... but I can carry you, nyeg!&r He lugs you up the last stretch, to the Crack of Fry.",
  ],
  "quest.47554875E9067723.title": "One Nibble to Share Them All",
  "quest.47554875E9067723.quest_desc": [
    "Walk through the crack to the &6Frying Edge&r above the fryer. What happens there, you have to see for yourself. After that the Smoke Guhs bring you home.",
  ],
  "quest.47554862451F16E5.title": "Long Live the King",
  "quest.47554862451F16E5.quest_desc": [
    "Back in the &aNibble Shire&r everyone is waiting for you. Araguh gets a crown of nibbles, Pippguh wants a second dessert, and you get the title &6Ring-Bearer&r and everything that comes with it.",
  ],
  "quest.4755484F35D7FA11.title": "It Stings Our Little Eyesss",
  "quest.4755484F35D7FA11.quest_desc": [
    "When Smikagol grabs at the ring on the mountain, use the &bLight Phial&r. He'll keep his pawsies to himself for a good long while.",
  ],
  "quest.47554855E3AC2E3F.title": "No More Range Hood",
  "quest.47554855E3AC2E3F.quest_desc": [
    "All three Smoke Guhlings are free. Remember them well: you'll see them again when the mountain starts to bubble.",
  ],
  "quest.475548436B8828CC.title": "A Black Tower Full of Smoke",
  "quest.475548436B8828CC.quest_desc": [
    "Not far from Guhladriel's tree city a black tower stands sputtering. That's the home of &6Sauceruman of Many Sauces&r, a wizard Mika who wants a bite of the ring too. Your &dSuper Compass&r knows the way (Barbecue tab). You don't need it for the journey, but it does smell yummy there, nyeg.",
  ],
  "quest.475548E59DC6327C.title": "Dough, Sauce and... Cheese?",
  "quest.475548E59DC6327C.quest_desc": [
    "Sauceruman isn't getting a bite, so he's baking a ring of his own. Fetch for his &6Ring Baker&r: &6ring dough&r from the Dough Kneader (one floor up), &6hot frying sauce&r from the Sauce Tap (two floors up) and &6cheese&r from the Cheese Cupboard (three floors up). Only, that cupboard is a little bit empty.",
  ],
  "quest.475548A45400E1BF.title": "One Ring to Eat Them All",
  "quest.475548A45400E1BF.quest_desc": [
    "Got everything? Then pull the lever of the &6Ring Baker&r, down in the hall. Stand back: it rumbles, it sputters, it shakes... DING!",
  ],
  "quest.475548D71942DB2C.title": "I'm Sulking",
  "quest.475548D71942DB2C.quest_desc": [
    "It turned out to be an &6onion ring&r. Sauceruman wanted cheese, this is a vegetable, so now he's sitting in his Sulking Corner. Offer him a bite. You get the &6Pannantír&r, a handful of onion rings, and from now on the Ring Baker bakes you an onion ring every day.",
  ],
  "quest.475548BD28073970.title": "Too Heavy, Nyeg",
  "quest.475548BD28073970.quest_desc": [
    "Take a look at the machines in the hall: &cToo heavy: there's not enough chonk power, so everything stands still&r. Sauceruman hooked five real machines up to a single &6Mika Wheel&r, and a Mika does not run. Go on, give the Mika a poke (right-click the wheel). So that's how NOT to do it. How to do it right is under &bGuh Technology&r: a Guh Wheel, with a guh in it.",
  ],
  "quest.475548DF63E1FE9D.title": "The Pannantír",
  "quest.475548DF63E1FE9D.quest_desc": [
    "At the top of the tower stands a pan you can see things in. Have a look inside (right-click). Mostly you see an eye that's feeling hungry. Afterwards you get to take one home yourself.",
  ],
  "quest.47554889FAE44D06.title": "A Ring Every Day",
  "quest.47554889FAE44D06.quest_desc": [
    "Even when Sauceruman is sulking, the &6Ring Baker&r still works: pull the lever and you get one &6onion ring&r a day. He isn't looking. He never looks.",
  ],
  "quest.475548A95CDCC5FC.title": "A Castle in the Sauce",
  "quest.475548A95CDCC5FC.quest_desc": [
    "Right in the middle of the Guhbarbecuether's frying sauce sea stands &6Big Nether Mika's Castle&r. The Super Compass (Barbecue > Big Nether Mika's Castle) shows the way; there's a little jetty in front of the gate.",
  ],
  "quest.4755480C7984EF66.title": "Seen from the Side",
  "quest.4755480C7984EF66.quest_desc": [
    "In the level hall, walk through the gate of &6level 1-1&r. Inside a level you look from the side: &dA&r and &dD&r walk, &dspace&r jumps (hold it = higher), &dS&r dives into a pipe, &dW&r goes through a door, sprinting is running. Nothing ever breaks and nobody hurts you: if you fall or get shoved, you're simply back at your last flag. &dQ&r twice = out.",
  ],
  "quest.4755485878E7E30D.title": "Six Flagpoles",
  "quest.4755485878E7E30D.quest_desc": [
    "Reach the flagpole of all six levels: the courtyard (1-1, 1-2), the cellars (2-1, 2-2) and the keep (3-1, 3-2). Each gate opens once the level before it is cleared.",
  ],
  "quest.475548CE07EF0498.title": "Eighteen Times Chonk",
  "quest.475548CE07EF0498.quest_desc": [
    "Every level hides three &6big chonk coins&r. They stay yours, even when you play the level again; the Guhdex (Tales > Super Guhrio) keeps track of which ones you have, level by level.",
  ],
  "quest.47554805AFF4AADE.title": "All in One Dash",
  "quest.47554805AFF4AADE.quest_desc": [
    "Start at level 1-1 and clear all six levels back to back, in order. Your time goes on the high score board (Guhdex > High Scores), next to the server record. Time you lose by stepping out of a level still counts, nyeg.",
  ],
  "quest.475548F577B8469E.title": "Level 1-1: The Courtyard",
  "quest.475548F577B8469E.quest_desc": [
    "The first gate on the left in the level hall. A painted lawn inside the castle walls: here you learn to walk, jump, bonk &6question blocks&r and land on top of &dGuhmbas&r. At the end of the lawn you dive into the big green pipe (&dS&r) and walk across the clouds and the treetops to the flagpole. Nyeg!",
  ],
  "quest.4755483B8CA942F9.title": "Level 1-2: The Hedge Garden",
  "quest.4755483B8CA942F9.quest_desc": [
    "The first gate on the right. Hedges to climb, cheese ponds to jump over and a &dShell Mika&r with a row of Guhmbas in front of him: jump on him and kick his shell away. Through the tower door (&dW&r) you get on top of the garden wall; that's where the flagpole stands.",
  ],
  "quest.4755482DA0916079.title": "In Another Part of the Castle",
  "quest.4755482DA0916079.quest_desc": [
    "Behind the flagpole of level 1-2, &dToad-guh&r is already waving. He has good news and bad news. &oThank you! But the princess is in another part of the castle, nyeg.&r The gate to the cellars (world 2) is open now.",
  ],
  "quest.47554803F15ACD30.title": "Three Times Chonk in the Courtyard",
  "quest.47554803F15ACD30.quest_desc": [
    "The three &6big chonk coins&r of level 1-1. One lies on top of the bricks (climb the hedge behind them and jump back), one lies on a little cloud (why is there a lone coin floating there?), and one lies somewhere only a mole ever goes. Then reach the flagpole.",
  ],
  "quest.475548418E82DEBA.title": "Three Times Chonk in the Hedge Garden",
  "quest.475548418E82DEBA.quest_desc": [
    "The three &6big chonk coins&r of level 1-2. One sits in a little box of bricks: you can only get in when you're big (the &dSuper Nibble&r is in the block just before it). One hangs high above the gap behind the little wall tower: jump far. And one is on the gardener's shelf. Then reach the flagpole.",
  ],
  "quest.475548A80B002AFD.title": "The Mole Hole",
  "quest.475548A80B002AFD.quest_desc": [
    "Not every pipe in the courtyard is just a pipe. Above one of them floats a little coin. Try diving in (&dS&r), nyeg.",
  ],
  "quest.475548DEC98FD1DD.title": "The Coin Greenhouse",
  "quest.475548DEC98FD1DD.quest_desc": [
    "On top of the hedge arch of level 1-2 there's a door. But how do you get up there? Next to the low little hedge in front of it, two coins float one above the other... try jumping underneath them. Some blocks you only see once you bonk your head against them.",
  ],
  "quest.475548FF37501B58.title": "Level 2-1: The Pipe Cellar",
  "quest.475548FF37501B58.quest_desc": [
    "The gate of &6level 2-1&r opens as soon as you've cleared the courtyard (1-1 and 1-2). Down here it's dark and packed with &agreen pipes&r: stand on one and press &dS&r to dive in. Watch out for the &dChomp Flowers&r: as long as one of those flowers is poking out of her pipe, you get a big wet smooch and you're back at your flag. Platforms glide back and forth over the cheese sauce; waiting is allowed, nyeg.",
  ],
  "quest.47554834A867AA0B.title": "Cellar Chonk",
  "quest.47554834A867AA0B.quest_desc": [
    "Find all six &6big chonk coins&r of the cellars. Two tips. In level 2-1 one hangs in a red cage: the &bexclamation switch&r that opens the cage is at the end of a little tunnel you don't fit into. A &dShell Mika&r's shell does: jump on him and give his shell a nudge. And in level 2-2 one lies in a spot you can only reach through a pipe, nyeg.",
  ],
  "quest.47554827C03856CE.title": "A Speckled Egg",
  "quest.47554827C03856CE.quest_desc": [
    "In &6level 2-2&r a fence with an &degg lock&r is in the way. It only opens for whoever is carrying &aGuhshi's Egg&r. Look for the door under the painted egg (press &dW&r when you're standing in it): in the little egg room it lies on a bed of hay.",
  ],
  "quest.475548F526116D15.title": "Crack... nyeg!",
  "quest.475548F526116D15.quest_desc": [
    "Carry the egg through the egg lock to the &6hatching nest&r, a warm little stove with straw on top. That's where &aGuhshi&r hatches from his egg. He thinks you're his mama. Jump onto the nest and he'll carry you: hold &dspace&r to flutter and click to stick out his tongue. Whoever bumps into you gets Guhshi instead of you; he then goes back to wait on his nest.",
  ],
  "quest.475548C17B0B759C.title": "Level 2-2: Guhshi's Nest",
  "quest.475548C17B0B759C.quest_desc": [
    "Ride Guhshi to the flagpole of &6level 2-2&r. You cross the big gap in the floor by fluttering (or on foot, on the slow platform). After that the gate of the keep opens: level 3-1.",
  ],
  "quest.475548E5E033C1B3.title": "Shortcut",
  "quest.475548E5E033C1B3.quest_desc": [
    "Not every pipe comes out where you think. Somewhere in level 2-2 a Chomp Flower lives in a pipe that leads to the &5warp room&r: three golden pipes with a number above them. Dive in and you're in that level right away, and its gate in the hall stays open for you from then on. The level you left from doesn't count as cleared then, nyeg.",
  ],
  "quest.475548DDE5BC31D0.title": "Level 3-1: The Grill Corridor",
  "quest.475548DDE5BC31D0.quest_desc": [
    "The gate of &6level 3-1&r opens once the cellars are cleared. Here &dGuhshi&r waits for whoever found his egg: walk into him and you're in the saddle. Hold space = flutter. Jump across the sauce from hub to hub of the spinning &6grill skewers&r and lure the &6Flomp Mikas&r down before you run underneath them. At the &dhitching post&r Guhshi waits for a bit: the part with the &6Fire Pepper&r you do on foot (a nibble through the gap flips the switch).",
  ],
  "quest.475548548DA1374B.title": "Level 3-2: The Sauce Cellar",
  "quest.475548548DA1374B.quest_desc": [
    "Guhshi's level. Two gaps are so wide that only his flutter jump makes it across (on foot, the &dtimer switch&r lays a bridge over them for eight seconds). In between: falling blocks under fast skewers, a platform under two Flomp Mikas, and behind a door the &6Pepper Room&r.",
  ],
  "quest.475548243DC9E3B0.title": "Six Times Chonk in the Keep",
  "quest.475548243DC9E3B0.quest_desc": [
    "The six &6big chonk coins&r of world 3. Tip: one hangs above the middle grill skewer, one lies under a Flomp Mika, one in a treasure room you can only reach through a pipe with a Chomp Flower, one high above the first big gap, one low between two falling blocks (a tiny hop!) and one in the cage of the Pepper Room.",
  ],
  "quest.47554823C17CD5F9.title": "Round 1: The Lever",
  "quest.47554823C17CD5F9.quest_desc": [
    "Behind the big gate, &6Big Nether Mika&r stands on his grate bridge. He throws slow glowing embers (jump over them) and when he lands, the thud shoves you away (jump at the right moment). Run &dunderneath him&r while he hangs in the air and pull the &6lever&r: half the bridge flomps into the sauce. The green pipe takes you back.",
  ],
  "quest.4755481BBB8A8168.title": "Round 2 and 3: Shell, Return to Sender",
  "quest.4755481BBB8A8168.quest_desc": [
    "On the short bridge he tucks into his shell and rolls back and forth: &djump over it&r. After three bonks against the wall the &6?-block&r is full again: grab the &6Fire Pepper&r and throw a nibble at the shell while it's rolling toward you. Then it bounces right back. Three on target and he can't brake anymore.",
  ],
  "quest.475548C463A00B72.title": "Big Nether Mika",
  "quest.475548C463A00B72.quest_desc": [
    "Win the duel. He splashes into the sauce, climbs back out on the other side (wet, sticky, offended, otherwise perfectly fine) and sits down to sulk. Nobody hurts anybody here, nyeg.",
  ],
  "quest.47554853B4A9F4DC.title": "A Piece of Cake",
  "quest.47554853B4A9F4DC.quest_desc": [
    "Watch how it ends: &dPrincess Peachguh&r, the cake, and why Big Nether Mika had taken her along in the first place. The Guhdex (Tales > Super Guhrio) plays the scene again. After that you're standing in the tower room.",
  ],
  "quest.4755484BD5553E34.title": "A Hero! Nyeg!",
  "quest.4755484BD5553E34.quest_desc": [
    "On the left of the castle forecourt stands a giant mushroom: &6Toad-guh&r's stall. He tells you what's going on: Big Nether Mika has taken Princess Peachguh away. For a piece of cake.",
  ],
  "quest.4755485575A35836.title": "Spending Coins",
  "quest.4755485575A35836.quest_desc": [
    "The &6coins&r from the levels go into your pouch (a coin counts the first time you grab it). At Toad-guh's you spend them on &doutfits&r and &dbuilding blocks&r. At every flagpole you also get a little tip: one coin for every five on your panel.",
  ],
  "quest.475548B92786A428.title": "It's-a Me, Guhrio!",
  "quest.475548B92786A428.quest_desc": [
    "The &cred cap with mustache&r costs 30 coins. Hold it (hold right-click) to unlock it and put it on your guh in the wardrobe. The mustache comes free.",
  ],
  "quest.475548EBBBB7F4BF.title": "The Green Brother",
  "quest.475548EBBBB7F4BF.quest_desc": [
    "Luiguh's &agreen cap&r costs 30 coins. No mustache, but just as brave. Mostly.",
  ],
  "quest.475548DB721C0B22.title": "A Shell on Your Back",
  "quest.475548DB721C0B22.quest_desc": [
    "The &aShell Mika Shell&r costs 40 coins. It won't make your guh slide any faster, but it sure looks tough.",
  ],
  "quest.47554804693FF697.title": "A Nibble a Day",
  "quest.47554804693FF697.quest_desc": [
    "You can put the &6Nibble Question Block&r down at home. Bonk it with your head: every day one cheese nibble pops out, one for each player. There's one on the forecourt too: go on, try it!",
  ],
  "quest.4755480DD81A02F8.title": "Through the Green Pipe",
  "quest.4755480DD81A02F8.quest_desc": [
    "The &aGreen Travel Pipe&r really works. Put two down (at most 50 blocks apart), stand on a pipe and &dsneak&r: you slide in and come out of the other one. With dye you make a second pair in another color. There's a pair ready on the forecourt.",
  ],
  "quest.47554804EE753C55.title": "Your Very Own Flagpole",
  "quest.47554804EE753C55.quest_desc": [
    "Stack &aCastle Flagpoles&r on top of each other: a base appears at the bottom by itself, and at the top the golden ball with the little pink flag. Click it for a little party.",
  ],
  "quest.475548E6BFF6012C.title": "Who's the Fastest?",
  "quest.475548E6BFF6012C.quest_desc": [
    "On the right of the forecourt stands the &6high score board&r: the server's fastest times, per level and for the whole castle in one go. Click the golden block and you'll see your own times next to them.",
  ],
  "quest.4755485005B27EAE.title": "Princess Peachguh",
  "quest.4755485005B27EAE.quest_desc": [
    "Win the duel with Big Nether Mika and talk to &dPrincess Peachguh&r in the tower room. She gives you her little crown and a cake. Kidnapped? Nah: the cake was just really yummy.",
  ],
  "quest.47554821F0593D47.title": "Guhshi Is Yours!",
  "quest.47554821F0593D47.quest_desc": [
    "Next to the princess, &aGuhshi&r is waiting. Click him and say yes: you get a Guhshi of your own, saddle and all. One per player; the one in the tower room stays there for the next hero.",
  ],
  "quest.475548F8A76475FF.title": "Guhshi in the Guhdex",
  "quest.475548F8A76475FF.quest_desc": [
    "A Guhshi of your own gets his page in the &dGuhdex&r. On his back you jump with &dspace&r; hold space in the air and he &dflutters&r across gaps as wide as seven blocks.",
  ],
  "quest.475548ECA8720FFA.title": "Long-Distance Nom",
  "quest.475548ECA8720FFA.quest_desc": [
    "Put a cheese nibble on the ground near your Guhshi. Zip: his long tongue snaps it up from as far as five blocks away. In his guh menu you can switch the tongue off if he needs to keep his paws off your stuff.",
  ],
  "quest.47554824E8A33A22.title": "The Golden Chonk Cap",
  "quest.47554824E8A33A22.quest_desc": [
    "Got all &6eighteen big chonk coins&r? Then go see Toad-guh: he has the &6Golden Chonk Cap&r for you. The Guhdex (Tales > Toad-guh's Stall and the Rewards) shows per level which chonk coins you're still missing.",
  ],
}
